        "context": "Prescribe only the first four weeks, 2026-10-12 through 2026-11-08, then extend after athlete feedback. Running only, exactly three runs weekly on Tuesday, Thursday and Sunday; all other weekdays unavailable. Sunday preferred for long run. Time limits: Tuesday and Thursday 60 minutes each; Sunday 100 minutes. For the last six weeks athlete has run three times weekly, approximately 22 km per week; longest recent run 9 km felt comfortable. Athlete is 35, reports no current injuries or health restrictions, and has flat roads and paths available. Prefers kilometres. Recorded fitness evidence: all-out flat 5 km race in 28:00 on 2026-09-25 in fair conditions, reflecting current fitness. Initial coaching default is an easy aerobic base block with weekly distances 22, 23, 24 and 19 km; fourth week deliberately cutback. Long runs 9, 10, 11 and 8 km. Effort and time limits take precedence over distance or pace. Later build and taper to be prescribed after feedback; no strength or other sports included."
